<view class="page-shell settings-page">
  <folio-header />
  <text class="settings-title">设置</text>
  <text class="subtle">当前小程序仅用于 M1 界面与导航验证。</text>

  <view class="settings-group folio-card">
    <view class="setting-row"><view class="setting-icon"><image src="/assets/icons/database.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="setting-copy"><text>数据模式</text><text>虚构演示 · 只读</text></view><text class="setting-state">已开启</text></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view class="setting-icon"><image src="/assets/icons/sparkle.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="setting-copy"><text>DeepSeek 测试 BFF</text><text>密钥仅可存在服务端环境</text></view><text class="setting-state muted">待接入</text></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view class="setting-icon"><image src="/assets/icons/lock.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="setting-copy"><text>应用解锁</text><text>密码与生物识别降级策略</text></view><text class="setting-state muted">M2</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-group folio-card">
    <button class="setting-action" bindtap="showPending">
      <view><text>Markdown 导入与导出</text><text>下一里程碑接入</text></view>
      <image src="/assets/icons/arrow-right-dark.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </button>
    <button class="setting-action" bindtap="showPending">
      <view><text>清除本地数据</text><text>需二次确认与当前密码</text></view>
      <image src="/assets/icons/arrow-right-dark.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </button>
  </view>
  <text class="build-note">Folio WeChat M1 · 不包含真实数据或 AI 密钥</text>
</view>
